Google Tag Manager (GTM) is a tag management system that enables marketers to add and update marketing tags (snippets of code) on their websites and mobile apps without needing to modify the code.

You can use Flash Attention V2.0 along with GTM to track attention metrics on your website. Here's a step-by-step process for implementing it:

