10. Next, create a new tag that sends the data to Google Analytics using Google's measurement protocol. You can find the necessary data elements in the GTM documentation (https://developers.google.com/analytics/devguides/collection/protocol/v1/devguide).

11. Publish the container with the new tag to make it live on your website.

