        # Pass in your textual data to the TextStreamer object.
        text_streamer.writeStrings(data)

        # Call the gather method to get the buffered text
        buffered_text = text_streamer.gather()

        # You can now do whatever you want with the text, for example, return it as a response:
        return buffered_text
```

3. In your browser page, call the method that you defined earlier and render the text in your template. Here's an example using the `zope.publisher.browser.HTMLOutput`:

```html
<% import MyView as my_view

my_text = my_view.render()
%>

